notes:
These are the primary sources the csoh.org kill chain cites. Every fact about the incident in this deck comes from that page, which draws on these.

MITRE ATT&CK documents the campaign, and CISA published remediation guidance. CyberArk's analysis, linked here as an archived copy, covers Golden SAML, and Sygnia covers detecting it. Palo Alto Networks published a timeline. The MITRE technique page defines T1606.002, SAML token forgery, the technique behind stage 04.

The background slides name their own sources, from Microsoft Learn and MITRE ATT&CK.

