The page names no related kill chain on csoh.org. These five are the related defense topics it links: IAM and federated identity, CI/CD pipeline security, detection engineering, cloud threat research, and Zero Trust architecture.

IAM stands for identity and access management. Zero Trust is a security model that grants no implicit trust based on network location.
